Statement of modification (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
---------------------------------------------------

The binary in this repository is NOT built from unmodified upstream MoltenVK.

It is built from a fork carrying changes proposed in MoltenVK pull request #2771,
which adds support for the VK_KHR_ray_query extension. That pull request had not
been merged into upstream MoltenVK at the time this binary was produced.

    Upstream project   https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK
    Pull request       https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK/pull/2771
    Source fork        https://github.com/dttdrv/MoltenVK
    Source branch      macgaming/ray-query-pr

One additional local change was made to the MoltenVK sources: a fix to
MVKDescriptorPool's destructor, which dereferenced a descriptor set layout pointer
that the Vulkan specification permits an application to have already destroyed.
The change is reproduced in full in:

    patches/0001-fix-descriptor-pool-destructor-dangling-layout.patch

No other modifications were made.


